<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.88 per cwt live, up 0.04 when compared to Monday's value. - USDA</p>
